Resident Evil 2026: The First 30 Minutes Reaction

Huge shoutout to @SonyPictures and @Reddit for the invite to see the first 30 minutes of Resident Evil early at The Grove. Forget the purists complaining about 1:1 game accuracy. Zach Cregger brought that raw Weapons tension directly into this universe, and it honestly feels like you’re right there with the controller in your hand. You definitely need to check this out on the biggest IMAX screen possible.

Head to the link in bio for my complete thoughts and exclusive director panel clips. I’ll be dropping my full review right after I see the rest of this movie in IMAX.

